---
// T04에서 본문을 Home 콘텐츠로 교체할 때까지 T02 디자인 확인 화면을 둔다.
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { ui, type Locale } from '../../i18n/ui';
import DesignPreview from '../DesignPreview.astro';

interface Props {
  locale: Locale;
}

const { locale } = Astro.props;
---

<BaseLayout locale={locale} description={ui[locale].pages.home.description}>
  <DesignPreview locale={locale} />
</BaseLayout>
